Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Boson-cloud metric evaluator", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"f7ae5b0e-2dd7-4bc3-bd39-2574b54b2dac"],

Cell["\<\
Notebook version of boson_cloud_metric.wl: evaluates the reconstructed metric \
perturbation h_ab of the boson cloud (traceful ORG, plus the ER completion), \
and its derivatives of any order, at any (r, \[Chi]), from the spectral data \
h_ORG_cloud.mx / .wdx exported by boson_cloud_pipeline_diag.wl. All functions \
return physical values, A^2 h with the amplitude A^2 of the run (cloud mass \
10^-4 M: A^2 = 3.99\[Times]10^-9); the option \"Amplitude\" -> \"Unit\" gives \
them per unit A^2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3d95db8e-3967-4199-9f58-e5ebd36bee05"],

Cell["\<\
How to use: Evaluation > Evaluate Notebook (or evaluate the cells of \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Definitions\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] in order, then \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Load and self-test\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Examples\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]). The definitions \
span several cells inside one package context: evaluate them in order, from \
the first. The data file is looked for in ../diag_11688456 relative to this \
notebook; edit dataFile if it is elsewhere. Do not give r or \[Chi] global \
values (the stored completion expressions use these symbols).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0195a271-5786-41c5-9b69-ff20581acff9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Conventions and formulas", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"4430d93d-bcf7-48c7-aa01-a4af294233fd"],

Cell["\<\
boson_cloud_metric.wl -- evaluate the reconstructed metric perturbation of \
the boson cloud, and its derivatives, at any (r, chi),
from the spectral data exported by boson_cloud_pipeline_diag.wl \
(h_ORG_cloud.mx or h_ORG_cloud.wdx).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d9e46ff5-77cf-440e-a9b0-866b89a83b66"],

Cell["\<\
Usage
Get[\"boson_cloud_metric.wl\"];
loadMetric[\"/path/to/diag_11688456/h_ORG_cloud.wdx\"];      (* or .mx (same \
Wolfram version / OS only) *)
bcmSelfTest[]                                               (* reference \
values, coframe, derivatives: run once *)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3d2863de-2586-4eb4-b5a8-b4db5cf03090"],

Cell["\<\
hComponent[\"hmbmb\", r, chi]              A^2 h_{mbar mbar} (particular ORG \
solution)
hComponent[\"hlmb\",  r, chi, {i, j}]      d^i/dr^i d^j/dchi^j of A^2 h_{l \
mbar}
hTetrad[r, chi]                          all tetrad components (ll, lm, lmb, \
mm, mbmb, mmb), A^2 (h_ORG + h_comp)
hTetrad[r, chi, {i, j}, \"Completion\" -> False, \"Amplitude\" -> \"Unit\"]
hCoord[r, chi, {i, j}]                   coordinate components h_{mu nu}, mu, \
nu in (v, r, chi, phi)   (4 x 4 matrix)
gKerr[r, chi, {i, j}]                    Kerr background g_{mu nu} (M = 1, a \
= threshold spin) in the same coordinates
gTotal[r, chi, {i, j}]                   gKerr + A^2 (h_ORG + h_comp)   (the \
full metric to first order in A^2)\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f6a45b8-833f-4854-9828-c5d81475c137"],

Cell["\<\
Conventions (as in the pipeline): M = 1; ingoing Kerr coordinates (v, r, chi \
= cos theta, phi); boosted Kinnersley tetrad
l, n = -d_r, m, mbar; traceful ORG h_{ab} n^b = 0; delta G_ab[h] = T_ab (8 pi \
G = 1). Everything (T_ab, h_ORG, the completion) is per unit
amplitude^2 A^2 of the Leaver normalization; the physical perturbation is A^2 \
(h_ORG + h_comp) with A^2 = completion[\"amp2\"]
(A^2 = 3.99e-9 for a cloud of mass 1e-4 M in diag_11688456). All functions \
return PHYSICAL values (times A^2) by default;
the option \"Amplitude\" -> \"Unit\" (hComponent, hCompletion, hTetrad, \
hCoord) gives them per unit A^2.
Tetrad components (order l, n, m, mbar):  ll, lm, lmb (= l mbar), mm, mbmb (= \
mbar mbar), mmb (= m mbar); all n-components vanish.
h_lm = conj(h_lmb), h_mm = conj(h_mbmb) (real metric); h_ll, h_mmb are real.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"342bd1dc-02c7-4430-b23c-36c6ae18d223"],

Cell["\<\
How each component is rebuilt (same formulas as the pipeline, sections 10, \
11, 15):
h_mbmb = sum_l Y_l(chi) [ -4 (r + i a chi)/(r - i a chi)^2 I3_l(r) - 2 (r + i \
a chi)^2/(r - i a chi)^2 I2_l(r) ],  Y_l = _{-2}Y_{l0};
I2, I3 from their per-panel Chebyshev coefficients for r - r+ < xMax, \
closed-form (Legendre Q) tails beyond.
h_mmb  = -(1 - chi^2) P(chi)^2 [ K2(r) + 2 r/(r^2 + a^2 chi^2) K3(r) ]  (S = \
sqrt(1 - chi^2) P); zero beyond xMax (|h| < e^{2 q xMax}).
h_lmb, h_ll: 2D Chebyshev interpolation of the node values (radial panel x \
chi); h_lmb is interpolated as h_lmb/sin(theta).
Outer region r > rMax: panels in zeta = rMax/r.
Derivatives are exact derivatives of these representations (Chebyshev \
differentiation, symbolic chain/Leibniz rules), to any order.
Inputs are converted to the working precision of the run (wp = 60 digits): \
give r, chi as exact numbers or with >= wp digits;
machine numbers are used as exact decimals (SetPrecision). Valid for r >= r+ \
and -1 <= chi <= 1 (chi-derivatives of h_lmb, which contains
sin(theta), are singular at chi = +-1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d06a8a8b-fcd2-4f4d-b09b-81defdce7be3"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Definitions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"dd691f35-ba88-48bd-884c-556eef65dc2f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"BeginPackage", "[", "\"\<BosonCloudMetric`\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<loadMetric[file] loads h_ORG_cloud.mx or h_ORG_cloud.wdx \
exported by boson_cloud_pipeline_diag.wl.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"hComponent", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<hComponent[comp, r, chi, {i, j}] gives d^i/dr^i d^j/dchi^j of \
the ORG tetrad component comp (\\\"hmbmb\\\", \\\"hmmb\\\", \\\"hlmb\\\", \
\\\"hll\\\") of the particular solution. {i, j} defaults to {0, 0}. Option \\\
\"Amplitude\\\" -> \\\"Physical\\\" (default: times A^2 of the run) or \
\\\"Unit\\\" (per unit A^2).\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"hCompletion", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<hCompletion[r, chi, {i, j}] gives the completion (ER zero modes \
with the Komar-fixed amplitudes) as an Association of tetrad components ll, \
lm, lmb. Option \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> \\\"Physical\\\" (default) or \\\"Unit\\\
\".\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"hTetrad", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<hTetrad[r, chi, {i, j}, opts] gives all tetrad components (ll, \
lm, lmb, mm, mbmb, mmb) of h_ORG + h_comp (options \\\"Completion\\\" -> \
True|False, \\\"Amplitude\\\" -> \\\"Physical\\\" (default) | \
\\\"Unit\\\").\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"hCoord", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<hCoord[r, chi, {i, j}, opts] gives the coordinate components \
h_{mu nu} (mu, nu = v, r, chi, phi) as a 4 x 4 matrix; same options as \
hTetrad.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"gKerr", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<gKerr[r, chi, {i, j}] gives the (i, j) derivative of the Kerr \
metric g_{mu nu} (M = 1, a = threshold spin) in ingoing coordinates (v, r, \
chi, phi).\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"gTotal", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<gTotal[r, chi, {i, j}, opts] gives gKerr + A^2 (h_ORG + h_comp) \
(option \\\"Completion\\\" -> True|False).\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"bcmParameters", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<bcmParameters[] gives the run parameters, grid sizes and \
completion data.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"bcmSelfTest", "::", "usage"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<bcmSelfTest[] checks the rebuilt components against the \
reference values of the run, the coframe against the stored completion, and \
the derivatives against finite differences.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Begin", "[", "\"\<`Private`\>\"", "]"}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.001581307414505*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"fe2028c6-7b8d-4116-a9b0-dd8d46148f0c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["loading", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c1336f1f-e7c9-42ce-87f2-15dbf15f5c3b"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"loadMetric", "[", "file_String", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "d", "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"!", 
         RowBox[{"FileExistsQ", "[", "file", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "nofile"}], "MessageName"], ",", 
           "file"}], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"Return", "[", "$Failed", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "r", "]"}], "||", 
         RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "\[Chi]", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "glob"}], "MessageName"], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"Return", "[", "$Failed", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"d", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Block", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"$Context", "=", "\"\<Global`\>\""}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"$ContextPath", "=", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"\"\<System`\>\"", ",", "\"\<Global`\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], 
          "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Import", "[", "file", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"If", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"!", 
         RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", "d", "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "bad"}], "MessageName"], ",", 
           "file"}], "]"}], ";", 
         RowBox[{"Return", "[", "$Failed", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"setup", "[", "d", "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<loaded \>\"", ",", "file", ",", "\"\<:  a = \>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"N", "[", 
         RowBox[{"aN", ",", "15"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<,  lmax = \>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", "lList", "]"}], ",", "\"\<,  wp = \>\"", ",", 
        "wp", ",", "\"\<,  \>\"", ",", "nPan", ",", "\"\< inner + \>\"", ",", 
        "nOut", ",", "\"\< outer panels x \>\"", ",", "nPn", 
        ",", "\"\< nodes,  nchi = \>\"", ",", "nchi", ",", "\"\<,  A^2 = \>\"",
         ",", 
        RowBox[{"N", "[", 
         RowBox[{"amp2", ",", "12"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ";"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "nofile"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<file `1` not found.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "bad"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<`1` does not contain the expected Association.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "bcmnl"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<no data loaded: call loadMetric[file] first.\>\""}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "glob"}], "MessageName"], 
   "=", "\"\<Global`r or Global`\[Chi] has a value; the exported expressions \
use these symbols. Clear them (Clear[r, \[Chi]]) and load again.\>\""}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"rcSub", "[", 
    RowBox[{"e_", ",", "rv_", ",", "cv_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"e", "/.", "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"s_Symbol", "/;", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Context", "[", "s", "]"}], "=!=", "\"\<System`\>\""}], "&&", 
       
       RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"\"\<r\>\"", ",", "\"\<\[Chi]\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"SymbolName", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "\[RuleDelayed]", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"SymbolName", "[", "s", "]"}], "===", "\"\<r\>\""}], ",", 
       "rv", ",", "cv"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"setup", "[", "d_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"g", "=", 
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<grid\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"p", "=", 
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<params\>\"", "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"dat", "=", "d"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"wp", "=", 
       RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<wp\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"aN", "=", 
       RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<a\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"rp", "=", 
       RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<rplus\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"kap", "=", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox["aN", "2"]}]]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"xB", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<xB\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"xMax", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<xMax\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"nPn", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<nPn\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"nchi", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<nchi\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"zB", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<zetaB\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"nPan", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "xB", "]"}], "-", "1"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"nOut", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "zB", "]"}], "-", "1"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"rMax", "=", 
       RowBox[{"rp", "+", "xMax"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"chiN", "=", 
       RowBox[{"g", "[", "\"\<chiNodes\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"sN", "=", 
       SqrtBox[
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox["chiN", "2"]}]]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"lList", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmbmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<lList\>\"", 
        "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"I123", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmbmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<I123\>\"", 
        "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"gC", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmbmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<g\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"Cup", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmbmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Cup\>\"", "]"}]}],
       ";", 
      RowBox[{"K123", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<K123\>\"", "]"}]}],
       ";", 
      RowBox[{"tauC", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<tau\>\"", "]"}]}], 
      ";", 
      RowBox[{"Ppoly", "=", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
         RowBox[{"rcSub", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hmmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<PpolyR\>\"", 
            "]"}], ",", "0", ",", "#1"}], "]"}], "]"}], "&"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"nodes", "[", "\"\<hlmb\>\"", "]"}], "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hlmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<inner\>\"", 
          "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hlmb\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<outer\>\"", 
          "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"nodes", "[", "\"\<hll\>\"", "]"}], "=", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hll\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<inner\>\"", "]"}],
          ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<hll\>\"", "]"}], "[", "\"\<outer\>\"", 
          "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"comp", "=", 
       RowBox[{"d", "[", "\"\<completion\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"amp2", "=", 
       RowBox[{"comp", "[", "\"\<amp2\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"cM", ",", "cA"}], "}"}], "=", 
       RowBox[{"comp", "[", "\"\<coefficients\>\"", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"cache", "=", 
       RowBox[{"Association", "[", "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"loaded", "=", "True"}], ";"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"loaded", "=", "False"}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"cache", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Association", "[", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"SetAttributes", "[", 
   RowBox[{"memo", ",", "HoldRest"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"memo", "[", 
    RowBox[{"key_", ",", "expr_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"KeyExistsQ", "[", 
      RowBox[{"cache", ",", "key"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"cache", "[", "key", "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"cache", "[", "key", "]"}], "=", "expr"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"check", "[", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", "loaded", "]"}], ",", "True", ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Message", "[", 
       StyleBox[
        RowBox[{"loadMetric", "::", "bcmnl"}], "MessageName"], "]"}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.001581312896439*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[12]:=",ExpressionUUID->"b571cab1-4986-4476-80b6-9937ea890113"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["numbers and Chebyshev utilities (as in the pipeline)", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"c9d1d848-854f-4790-910c-01b89e490e5d"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"toWP", "[", "x_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Which", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Precision", "[", "x", "]"}], "===", "\[Infinity]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "wp"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Precision", "[", "x", "]"}], "===", "MachinePrecision"}], ",", 
     
     RowBox[{"SetPrecision", "[", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", "wp"}], "]"}], ",", "True", ",", "x"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"chebMat", "[", "nn_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"memo", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<chebMat\>\"", ",", "nn"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         FractionBox[
          RowBox[{"2", " ", 
           RowBox[{"If", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"k", "\[Equal]", "0"}], ",", 
             FractionBox["1", "2"], ",", "1"}], "]"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"Cos", "[", 
            FractionBox[
             RowBox[{"k", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"j", "+", 
                FractionBox["1", "2"]}], ")"}]}], "nn"], "]"}]}], "nn"], ",", 
         
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", 
           RowBox[{"nn", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"j", ",", "0", ",", 
           RowBox[{"nn", "-", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "wp"}], "]"}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"chebDer", "[", "c_List", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"nn", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "c", "]"}], "-", "1"}]}], ",", "dd"}], "}"}], 
     ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"dd", "=", 
       RowBox[{"ConstantArray", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", 
         RowBox[{"nn", "+", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      RowBox[{"Do", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"dd", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "k", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}],
          "=", 
